//   R2, S1; PA.I.B K1a to K4, R1, S1 to S3; PA.III.A.K8 NTSB reporting; PA.I.D.K6 intercept procedures; PA.I.E.K2 chart symbols; PA.XII.A K1,
//   K2, R1, R3, R4, S2 to S5; code scheme PA.I.C.K2; the evaluator must test elements missed on the knowledge test; its appendix table still
